  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Slice pear into wedges. Halve the cherry tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62270d5fc440d406883fe8d2/step-2802d8cb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks. Place on lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Bake until golden, 5-7 minutes. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62270d5fc440d406883fe8d2/step-d5c3d1a6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. On a large plate (or in a large bowl), combine the plain flour and Aussie spice blend. Season, then add haloumi, turning to coat. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62270d5fc440d406883fe8d2/step-8202d682.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat the butter and a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook pear, stirring regularly, until softened, 3-5 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the honey and cook, stirring, until reduced and sticky, 2-3 minutes.\n• Transfer to a large bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62270d5fc440d406883fe8d2/step-2f37ff3b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. When oil is hot, cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Meanwhile, to the bowl with the pear, add mixed salad leaves, tomatoes, croutons and mustard cider dressing. Toss to combine, then season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62270d5fc440d406883fe8d2/step-522d4b7a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide caramelised pear salad with croutons between bowls. Top with haloumi. Sprinkle with grated Parmesan cheese to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62270d5fc440d406883fe8d2/step-5d83da86.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
